<section class="smallprint">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="k">The small print, in plain English</p>
    <div class="terms">
      <div class="term"><h3>It stays&nbsp;yours</h3><p>You keep the copyright to everything you send. Always.</p></div>
      <div class="term"><h3>We ask before we&nbsp;publish</h3><p>Nothing appears on this site, in a box, or in a bottle without your written yes.</p></div>
      <div class="term"><h3>No fee to enter, no&nbsp;purchase</h3><p>You do not need to have bought anything. Open to anyone over 18.</p></div>
      <div class="term"><h3>If yours is&nbsp;chosen</h3><p>You are credited by name in the printed edition, sent the first bottle of the run, and paid a commission fee agreed with you beforehand.</p></div>
